{"id":43,"titleZh":"音乐会小测验：你有多懂音乐？","titleEn":"Quiz-Concert: How Musical Are You?","date":"1968-05-26","dateZh":"1968 年 5 月 26 日","concepts":"听觉判断力、排除法听辨、新古典主义、基础音乐术语","thesis":"这是一场电视音乐小测验——不考作曲家生卒年份，专测你的耳朵能不能通过细节听出时代、风格和故意演错的漏洞。","plain":"怕考试的孩子听到测验就紧张，伯恩斯坦却把规则定成一场听觉推理：听陌生的片段，靠编制大小排除法推断作曲年代；找指挥故意打错的拍子；辨认乐器声部——最终考卷只剩一个问题：“你听享受了吗？”","scenes":["给全场观众发下纸笔连考六关：播莫扎特《费加罗的婚礼》序曲抛出五道陷阱题（有没有长号？有没有钢琴独奏？），接着伯恩斯坦当场故意把二拍子指挥成三拍子、并在木管里偷偷塞进一支萨克斯风让大家“找茬”。","在钢琴上连考十个音乐术语后，用虚假广告词套唱《花之圆舞曲》、以二拍改造圆舞曲以及大调版悲伤披头士歌曲打破固定成见，最后重听里姆斯基《西班牙随想曲》盲猜华彩乐器。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1v54y1d7iR","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1v54y1d7iR","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 测测你的乐感","duration":"50:54","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/quiz-concert","repertoire":[{"composer":"Brahms","piece":"Symphony No. 1 in C Minor, Op. 68 (Ending)","titleZh":"第一交响曲尾声","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Brahms%20Symphony%20No.%201%20in%20C%20Minor%2C%20Op.%2068+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Brahms%20Symphony%20No.%201%20in%20C%20Minor%2C%20Op.%2068"},{"composer":"Mozart","piece":"Overture to The Marriage of Figaro","titleZh":"费加罗的婚礼序曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview71/v4/c4/57/67/c4576747-7bbd-22f2-d3e7-eff9555ec40d/mzaf_7234035492583328503.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/overture-to-the-marriage-of-figaro/201399388?i=201399495&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Jane Glover & Royal Philharmonic Orchestra","recordingTrack":"Overture to \"The Marriage of Figaro\"","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mozart%20Overture%20to%20The%20Marriage%20of%20Figaro+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mozart%20Overture%20to%20The%20Marriage%20of%20Figaro"},{"c